.TH DIFTRAYWM-HELP 7
.SH NAME
DiftrayWM help index
.SH SYNOPSIS
Use :help {topic} or :h {topic} from a DiftrayWM command bar.
.SH PAGES
.TP
help-pager
Pager navigation, searching, and bookmarks.
.TP
notelets
Creating and opening Notelets.
.TP
commands
Frequently used Command Bar commands.
.TP
keymap
The keymap INI file: chords, actions, profiles and the two prefixes.
.TP
diftrayctl
Controlling a running session from a shell.
.TP
diftrayremap
System-wide key remapping with libudev, libevdev and uinput.
.SH QUICK START
Type :help help-pager for pager keys. Type :help find cursor to search the
current page with an Oniguruma regular expression. Type :help keymap for the
key remapping format, since every key is configured in keymap.ini.
